*-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
 Solution description
 ====================
 
 - Name: ALPS2017
 
 - Files: ALPS2017_XYZ.CRD: geocentric Cartesian station positions  
          ALPS2017_XYZ.VEL: geocentric Cartesian station velocities  
          ALPS2017_NEH.CRD: ellipsoidal station positions  
          ALPS2017_NEH.VEL: ellipsoidal station velocities  
          ALPS2017.SNX: Multi-year solution for geocentric Cartesian station 
                        positions and velocities referring to the IGb08, 
                        epoch 2010.0 in SINEX (Solution (Software/technique) 
                        INdependent EXchange) format

 - Time span: 2005-01-01 - 2016-05-29
 
 - Reference frame: IGb08/ITRF2008
 
 - Datum realization: no-net-rotation and no-net-translation conditions with
   respect to selected IGb08 reference stations
 
 - IGb08 stations used in datum conditions:
      GRAS 10002M006
      GRAZ 11001M002
      LROC 10023M001
      MEDI 12711M003
      WTZR 14201M010
      ZIMM 14001M004
      
 - Citation: Sánchez L., Voelksen Ch., Sokolov1 A., Arenz H., Seitz F. (2018)
   Present-day surface deformation of the Alpine Region inferred from geodetic
   techniques, Earth System Science Data Journal, submitted February 2018
